        "a": "The Five Ks are five articles of faith worn by initiated Sikhs: kesh (uncut hair), kangha (wooden comb), kara (steel bracelet), kachhera (undergarment), and kirpan (ceremonial sword). [NEEDS GURSIMAR REVIEW]",
        "flagged": true
